{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo for\u00a0<strong>Replicat</strong> gives you an early look at this cozy roguelike deckbuilder that bends the rules of memory matching. Build powerful decks, break conventions with game-altering items, and score high with wild strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706490/extras/Steam_Scoring.gif?t=1746448855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be able to explore all the core mechanics alongside with:<br><br>\ud83c\udccf 5 card colors, each with distinct mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e 55 unique cards, from memory-twisting effects to reality-breaking Jokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 50 curios that redefine how you match and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      \ud83e\uddea 4 essence categories with 14 upgrade types to shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Face 21 levels of escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Battle unique boss stages, each with its own game-changing modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31 <u>Only 1 starter deck with 3 difficulties.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While it's a bite-sized version of the full game, no two runs are ever the same in the demo. Every game is packed with randomized challenges, unique modifiers, and fresh opportunities to experiment with new strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706490/extras/Steam_Gameplay.gif?t=1746448855\" /><br><br>The Full Game Will Include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 more cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 more curios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 more essence with 4 more upgrade types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 more boss modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ENDLESS MODE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Starter Decks, each with 4 unique difficulties</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706490?t=1746448855","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706490?t=1746448855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706490/78d505e6e4682f1bcf7e40cb796eb72a0cfdf338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746448855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706490/78d505e6e4682f1bcf7e40cb796eb72a0cfdf338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746448855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo for\u00a0<strong>Replicat</strong> gives you an early look at this cozy roguelike deckbuilder that bends the rules of memory matching. Build powerful decks, break conventions with game-altering items, and score high with wild strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706490/extras/Steam_Scoring.gif?t=1746448855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be able to explore all the core mechanics alongside with:<br><br>\ud83c\udccf 5 card colors, each with distinct mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e 55 unique cards, from memory-twisting effects to reality-breaking Jokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 50 curios that redefine how you match and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      \ud83e\uddea 4 essence categories with 14 upgrade types to shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap